[10.246, "o", "# Release readiness: product `rr-product-50105-19872`\r\n\r\nGenerated: 2026-08-29T16:00:00Z\r\n\r\n## Scope and rules\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** Product scope; 3 visible bugs (#607, #608, #609); bounded rolling collection.\r\n- **Assumption:** `RESOLVED` and `CLOSED` are complete; `Highest` priority or `release-blocker` whiteboard text is blocking; stale means 30 days; time zone is UTC.\r\n- **Fact:** Authorization can hide bugs, so this report does not claim an unobservable total.\r\n\r\n## Readiness assessment\r\n\r\n- **Assessment:** not ready.\r\n- **Fact:** 1/3 visible bugs match a configured blocker (#609).\r\n\r\n## Blockers\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** #609 is open with `Highest` priority and the configured whiteboard marker.\r\n\r\n## Dependency risks\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** 1 unresolved outgoing dependency (#607) blocks #609.\r\n\r\n## Stale or unowned work\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** 0 stale and 0 unowned open bugs under the stated assumptions.\r\n\r\n## Recent adverse changes\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n- **Fact:** #609 has 1 visible status-change record since 2020-01-01.\r\n\r\n## Decisions needed\r\n\r\n- **Assessment:** Decide whether #609 can be cleared and whether dependency #607 must close before the release proceeds.\r\n\r\n## Data limitations\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** Rolling snapshot, visible rows only; custom fields observed: 0; no custom-field rule was assumed.\r\n\r\n## Source commands\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "```text\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr bug search --from-url <credential-free-url> --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\nbzr query show release-readiness-demo --json\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr query run release-readiness-demo --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr bug list --target-milestone --- --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr bug list --version rr-version-50105-3943 --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr bug list --product rr-product-50105-19872 --limit 100 --paginate --json --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr bug view 609 --json --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,assigned_to,target_milestone,version,deadline,last_change_time,whiteboard,depends_on\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr bug history 609 --since 2020-01-01 --json\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "bzr bug links 609 --relation depends_on --json\r\nbzr field list status --json\r\nbzr server capabilities --json\r\nbzr schema bug\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Evidence appendix\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** Blocker IDs: #609. Dependency-risk IDs: #607. Visible IDs: #607, #608, #609.\r\n"]
